        },
        {
          "name": "Setup Function",
          "type": "TSetupFunction"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "template<TSetupFunction> void",
      "docs": "More advanced variant of screen pass drawing. Supports overriding blend / depth stencil\npipeline state, and providing a custom vertex shader. Shader parameters are not bound by\nthis method, instead the user provides a setup function that is called prior to draw, but\nafter setting the PSO. This setup function should assign shader parameters."
